meta {
  name: 04 - Search & Ask
  seq: 4
}

docs {
  `/document/ask` (RAG via Ollama + vector store), `/document/search` (lexical OpenSearch
  query against document metadata), and `/document/search/hybrid` (vector + lexical fused
  via Reciprocal Rank Fusion). These operate collection-wide, not against a single
  `{{documentId}}` - run a few documents from `01 - Create` through to `INDEXED` first so
  there's something to find.

  `ask` responses depend on an LLM and can take 30-90s locally; the request timeout in this
  collection is set generously to accommodate that.
}
